        "heading_DJByPG": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Create a Custom Promise Ring for Her",
            "heading_tag": "h1"
          }
        },
        "richtext_bVjiyJ": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>For a romantic look, consider soft shapes or meaningful colors or even a two-stone setting. For someone who prefers minimal jewelry, choose a delicate band or understated design that can become part of her everyday collection.<br/><br/>A personalized promise ring for a girlfriend or partner can mark a first anniversary, a shared milestone, a long distance relationship or a commitment to the future.<br/><br/>The most important part is not how large or elaborate the ring is. It is the thought behind the details you choose.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
